   "text": "With two alleles at each site (rs429358 T>C; rs7412 C>T) there are four possible allele combinations on one chromosome: rs429358 T with rs7412 C; rs429358 T with rs7412 T; rs429358 C with rs7412 C; rs429358 C with rs7412 T. Which combination a person carries cannot be read from either rsID alone and requires both genotypes (and phase when both sites are heterozygous).",
